      "content": "Please do not put butter or lotion on a burn; this can trap heat and worsen the injury. Immediately run the burned area under cool or lukewarm (not cold) running water for at least 10 to 20 minutes. After cooling it, cover the burn loosely with a clean, non-adhesive bandage or clean cloth. Because you have blistering, it is very important to seek medical attention to ensure proper care and prevent infection.",
