    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i've seen people do this all the time and it seems fine. the redness isnt even that bad, it's just a tiny bit of skin peeling. if i just use a thick layer of antibiotic ointment or even some honey, won't that just act as a barrier and stop it from getting worse? i really need a way to just manage this myself without going to a clinic. what's the best thing to put on it right now so i can just get on with my day?",
